---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { COSY_RATE_PER_GUEST, DELUXE_ADDON_PER_GUEST } from '../lib/rat-race';
---

<Layout 
  title="The Cosy Canvas Co. | Luxury Bell Tent Hire & Camping Stays Scotland" 
  description="Custom luxury bell tent stays delivered and pitched for you across Scotland's wild coastal spots, lochs, and campsites."
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative bg-transparent overflow-hidden border-b border-stone-200/60 py-12 md:py-20 lg:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
        
        <!-- Left Hero Content -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7D6E23]/10 border border-[#7D6E23]/20 text-[#4F571A] text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase">
            <span class="os-grid-badge px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px]">FALKIRK CONTAINER</span>
            <span>🌿 Luxury Bell Tent Rentals Scotland</span>
          </div>

          <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-[#111111] leading-tight">
            We Deliver. <br/>
            We Setup. <br/>
            <span class="text-[#7D6E23]">We Collect.</span>
          </h1>

          <p class="text-stone-600 text-lg sm:text-xl font-light leading-relaxed">
            Custom luxury bell tent stays pitched and styled for you at Scotland's most breathtaking wild coastal spots, coves, and campsites. You just arrive and switch off.
          </p>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 py-4 border-y border-stone-200/80 my-2">
            <div>
              <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold font-display text-[#7D6E23]">From £50/n</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-stone-500">4M (£50/n), 5M (£75/n) & 6M (£100/n)</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold font-display text-[#111111]">Save Up To 25%</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-stone-500">Multi-Night Stays & 15% Early Bird 2027</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 pt-2">
            <a href="/booking" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-[#F7BA1E] hover:bg-[#D4A51E] text-[#111111] font-display font-extrabold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider py-4 px-8 rounded-full transition-all shadow-lg shadow-[#F7BA1E]/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-compass"></i>
              <span>Begin your booking</span>
            </a>
            <a href="/campsites" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-white/90 hover:bg-white text-stone-800 border border-stone-300 font-display font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider py-4 px-8 rounded-full transition-all shadow-sm">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-map-pin text-[#7D6E23]"></i>
              <span>Scottish Campsites Guide</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Visual Grid -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-6">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-stone-200 group h-72 sm:h-80">
              <img src="/cosy_canvas_hero_coastal_pitch.jpg" alt="White bell tent pitched on coastal Scottish cove" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/800x600/FAF7EE/7D6E23?text=Scottish+Coastal+Bell+Tent+Stay'"/>
              <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
              <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 text-white flex items-center justify-between">
                <div>
                  <span class="os-grid-badge text-[#F7BA1E] text-[10px] bg-black/40 border-[#F7BA1E]/40 px-2 py-0.5 rounded backdrop-blur-sm">SCOTTISH COASTAL SETUP</span>
                  <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-sm sm:text-base mt-1">Remote Ocean Cove Stays</h3>
                </div>
                <span class="bg-[#7D6E23] text-white text-[10px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded">100% WATERPROOF</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-md border border-stone-200 group h-44">
              <img src="/cosy_canvas_hero_cinema_lounge_night.jpg" alt="Inside cosy bell tent illuminated with laser light projector" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/400x300/FAF7EE/7D6E23?text=Cosy+Night+Ambience'"/>
              <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
              <div class="absolute bottom-2.5 left-2.5 right-2.5 text-white text-xs font-bold">
                Starry Cinema & Living Lounge
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-md border border-stone-200 group h-44">
              <img src="/cosy_canvas_hero_highland_valley_glow.jpg" alt="Glow of illuminated bell tent in remote mountain valley at twilight" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/400x300/FAF7EE/7D6E23?text=Twilight+Stay'"/>
              <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
              <div class="absolute bottom-2.5 left-2.5 right-2.5 text-white text-xs font-bold">
                Highland Valley Warm Glow
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Value Proposition Features -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-sm border-b border-stone-200/80">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14">
        <span class="text-[#7D6E23] font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2">A SIMPLE WAY TO SLOW DOWN IN NATURE</span>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#111111]">
          Tailored Outdoors. Built For Pure Comfort.
        </h2>
        <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-[#F7BA1E] mx-auto mt-4 rounded-full"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
        <a href="/camping-hire" class="light-card light-card-interactive rounded-xl p-6 cursor-pointer block bg-white/90">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-[#7D6E23]/10 text-[#7D6E23] flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-truck-ramp-box"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-[#111111] text-lg mb-2">Flexible Fulfillment</h3>
          <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Choose <strong>Free DIY Pickup</strong> from our Falkirk container or <strong>Cosy Camping Deluxe</strong> white-glove pitch and collection across Scotland (£225 flat fee).
          </p>
        </a>

        <a href="/camping-hire" class="light-card light-card-interactive rounded-xl p-6 cursor-pointer block bg-white/90">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-[#F7BA1E]/20 text-[#D4A51E] flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-bed"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-[#111111] text-lg mb-2">Modular Bedding</h3>
          <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Select DIY sleeping (Free), Essentials air frames (£25/guest), or Cosy Camping hotel duvets & crisp linens (£35/guest).
          </p>
        </a>

        <a href="/camping-hire" class="light-card light-card-interactive rounded-xl p-6 cursor-pointer block bg-white/90">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-[#7D6E23]/10 text-[#7D6E23] flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-sliders"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-[#111111] text-lg mb-2">Bespoke Camp Add-ons</h3>
          <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Customize your stay with wood burners, kitchen packs, Starlink Wi-Fi, cinema lounges, outdoor awnings, and beach kit.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a href="/faqs" class="light-card light-card-interactive rounded-xl p-6 cursor-pointer block bg-white/90">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-[#F7BA1E]/20 text-[#D4A51E] flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-5">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-[#111111] text-lg mb-2">Fix-It-Fast Guarantee</h3>
          <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Priority support throughout your stay plus seamless booking terms and full refund guarantee if not 100% happy.
          </p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Full Width Scottish Wilderness Banner Section -->
  <section class="relative w-full h-[480px] md:h-[580px] overflow-hidden border-b border-stone-200/80">
    <img src="/cosy_canvas_scotland_wilderness_banner.jpg" alt="Breathtaking Scottish landscape with a luxury illuminated bell tent" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center transform scale-105 hover:scale-100 transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out" onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/1920x800/111111/F7BA1E?text=Scottish+Wilderness+Canvas+Experience'"/>
    
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#111111]/90 via-[#111111]/65 to-transparent flex items-center">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 w-full">
        <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-5">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#F7BA1E]/20 border border-[#F7BA1E]/40 backdrop-blur-md">
            <span class="os-grid-badge text-[#F7BA1E] text-[10px] bg-black/50 border-[#F7BA1E]/40 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">HIGHLANDS & LOCHS</span>
            <span class="text-stone-100 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">🌿 Unmatched Outdoor Luxury</span>
          </div>

          <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white leading-tight">
            Breathtaking Landscapes. <br/>
            <span class="text-[#F7BA1E]">Five-Star Comfort.</span>
          </h2>

          <p class="text-stone-200 text-sm md:text-base font-light leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
            From the rugged sea cliffs of Sutherland to the tranquil shores of Loch Lomond, experience Scotland’s wild heart with hotel duvets, starry lighting, and heavy-duty 100% waterproof canvas.
          </p>

          <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
            <a href="/booking" class="bg-[#F7BA1E] hover:bg-[#D4A51E] text-[#111111] font-display font-extrabold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider py-4 px-8 rounded-full transition-all shadow-lg flex items-center gap-2 transform hover:-translate-y-0.5">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-compass"></i>
              <span>Plan Your Journey</span>
            </a>
            <span class="text-stone-300 text-xs font-mono border-l border-stone-500/60 pl-4 py-1 hidden sm:inline-block">
              POLMONT DEPOT DISPATCH • 200 MILE RADIUS
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Service Selection Grid -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-[#FAF7EE]/60 border-b border-stone-200/80">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <span class="text-[#7D6E23] font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2">DISCOVER OUR SERVICES</span>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#111111]">What Are You Planning?</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <a href="/events/rat-race" class="light-card light-card-interactive rounded-2xl overflow-hidden cursor-pointer group flex flex-col justify-between block bg-white/90 md:col-span-3">
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-[280px_1fr] gap-0">
            <div class="relative h-48 md:h-full min-h-[12rem] overflow-hidden">
              <img src="/events/rat-race-c2c-tile.webp" alt="Rat Race Scotland Coast to Coast official event tile" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" />
              <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 os-grid-badge text-[10px] px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md">RAT RACE 2027 · BOOKABLE</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6 flex flex-col justify-center">
              <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-[#111111] mb-2 group-hover:text-[#7D6E23] transition-colors">Rat Race Coast to Coast canvas</h3>
              <p class="text-stone-600 text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">Saturday night 11 September 2027. Cosy £{COSY_RATE_PER_GUEST}/guest, Deluxe +£{DELUXE_ADDON_PER_GUEST} for an indoor lounge and kitchen. Same rate in a 4M or 6M — we pack from headcount. We pitch Friday and pack up on Sunday 12 September. Optional Morrisons Fort William shop once you send a list.</p>
              <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#7D6E23] mt-4 group-hover:text-[#111111] transition-colors">Book Rat Race glamping →</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/camping-hire" class="light-card light-card-interactive rounded-2xl overflow-hidden cursor-pointer group flex flex-col justify-between block bg-white/90">
          <div>
            <div class="relative h-48 overflow-hidden">
              <img src="/planning_coastal_mountain_camping.jpg" alt="Coastal and Mountain Bell Tent Camping Scotland" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/600x400/FAF7EE/7D6E23?text=Coastal+%26+Mountain+Camping'"/>
              <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 os-grid-badge text-[10px] px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md">GLAMPING & CAMPING</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6">
              <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-[#111111] mb-2 group-hover:text-[#7D6E23] transition-colors">Coastal & Mountain Camping</h3>
              <p class="text-stone-600 text-xs leading-relaxed">4M, 5M & 6M bell tents delivered to Scottish campsites or wild coastal spots.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 pt-0">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#7D6E23] flex items-center gap-2 group-hover:text-[#111111] transition-colors">Explore Camping Hire &rarr;</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/parties" class="light-card light-card-interactive rounded-2xl overflow-hidden cursor-pointer group flex flex-col justify-between block bg-white/90">
          <div>
            <div class="relative h-48 overflow-hidden">
              <img src="/planning_kids_parties_sleepovers.jpg" alt="Kids Bell Tent Party and Garden Sleepover Setup" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/600x400/FAF7EE/7D6E23?text=Kids+Parties+%26+Sleepovers'"/>
              <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 os-grid-badge text-[10px] px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md">GARDEN SLEEPOVERS</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6">
              <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-[#111111] mb-2 group-hover:text-[#7D6E23] transition-colors">Kids Parties & Sleepovers</h3>
              <p class="text-stone-600 text-xs leading-relaxed">Delivered & pitched directly in your back garden with movie & gaming options.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 pt-0">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#7D6E23] flex items-center gap-2 group-hover:text-[#111111] transition-colors">Configure Kids Party &rarr;</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/events" class="light-card light-card-interactive rounded-2xl overflow-hidden cursor-pointer group flex flex-col justify-between block bg-white/90">
          <div>
            <div class="relative h-48 overflow-hidden">
              <img src="/planning_bespoke_canvas_villages.jpg" alt="Bespoke Glamping Canvas Villages for Scottish Weddings and Events" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/600x400/FAF7EE/7D6E23?text=Bespoke+Canvas+Villages'"/>
              <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 os-grid-badge text-[10px] px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md">WEDDINGS & RETREATS</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6">
              <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xl sm:text-2xl text-[#111111] mb-2 group-hover:text-[#7D6E23] transition-colors">Bespoke Canvas Villages</h3>
              <p class="text-stone-600 text-xs leading-relaxed">Glamping villages and bridal suites for weddings and corporate gatherings.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 pt-0">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#7D6E23] flex items-center gap-2 group-hover:text-[#111111] transition-colors">Request Event Quote &rarr;</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Customer Testimonials Section -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-transparent border-b border-stone-200/80">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <span class="text-[#7D6E23] font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">LOVED BY COSY ADVENTURERS</span>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#111111]">What Our Guests Say</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="light-card rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col justify-between bg-white/90">
          <div>
            <div class="text-[#F7BA1E] text-sm mb-3">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
            </div>
            <p class="text-stone-600 text-xs leading-relaxed italic mb-4">
              "Trystan and his team really got us out of a fix! Fast setup, incredible accommodation, and seamless collection. We will definitely book again without hesitation."
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-t pt-3 border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
            <span class="font-bold text-[#111111]">Annie</span>
            <span class="text-stone-400">Loch Lomond Stay</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="light-card rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col justify-between bg-white/90">
          <div>
            <div class="text-[#F7BA1E] text-sm mb-3">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
            </div>
            <p class="text-stone-600 text-xs leading-relaxed italic mb-4">
              "The set up was perfect when we arrived and collection afterwards was just as smooth. Made the whole trip so much easier and more enjoyable!"
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-t pt-3 border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
            <span class="font-bold text-[#111111]">Rhys L.</span>
            <span class="text-stone-400">Coastal Sutherland Stay</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="light-card rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col justify-between bg-white/90">
          <div>
            <div class="text-[#F7BA1E] text-sm mb-3">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
            </div>
            <p class="text-stone-600 text-xs leading-relaxed italic mb-4">
              "Dealing with the company from initial inquiry to setup was completely effortless. The kids loved watching movies in the tent!"
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-t pt-3 border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
            <span class="font-bold text-[#111111]">Donna R.</span>
            <span class="text-stone-400">Falkirk Garden Sleepover</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>